            <profile id="7249d613-387d-5a0c-927d-823f057e56d1" name="Marius Gage" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
             <characteristics>
              <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Character. Fleet Coordination: Once per battle round, one friendly ship may take the benefit of the selected Fleet Order a second time — a second Damage Control attempt, a second Evade, or the same order applied twice where its effect allows. It may not be used to exceed a limit the order itself states.</characteristic>
