             <characteristics>
              <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Character. Adapt and Overcome: Once per battle round, one friendly ship taking the benefit of the selected Fleet Order may re-roll one failed roll directly associated with that order.</characteristic>
