         <characteristics>
          <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">One Crew point; +2 to its boarding die. Maximum 1 per ship, and it does not count against the Terminator limit. Friendly boarding parties aboard the same ship gain +1 to their dice while this unit remains alive.</characteristic>
